# List of defects or bugs encountered in the application

# 1 - Notification cut off
Category: Cosmetic
Status: Fixed (Sprint 32, 2026-08-13)

Detail: In messages page, when clicking the notification bell, the notification popup appears, but the left side of the notifcation is cut off by the outer frame of the app.

Root cause: two overlapping causes. (1) The popup was `position: absolute` inside an ancestor
at MessagingCenter.jsx:552 carrying `overflow: hidden` (which is there to clip content to the
card's `borderRadius: 18` — so it could not simply be removed). (2) Independently, the popup's
`right: 0` plus its 340px width pushed it ~21px past the left edge of a 375px viewport even
with no clipping at all.

Fix: NotificationBell.jsx popup switched to `position: fixed` with an anchor rect captured on
open and refreshed on resize + scroll, and a clamped `left` that keeps the popup within 16px of
both viewport edges. MessagingCenter.jsx was left untouched.
