# 2 - Medals and Awards Keep popping up
Category: Functionality
Status: Fixed (Sprint 32, 2026-08-13)
Detail: When landing on my profile page I receive a series of badges/medals for accomplishments. When returning to the page again, I get another series of popups for mostly the same medals and awards. The logic is delivering the same award notification multiple times.

Root cause: NOT missing persistence — localStorage persistence (`pd_milestones_shown_${startYear}`)
already existed and its read/write keys matched. The bug was *when* it wrote: dismissMilestone()
marked milestones shown one at a time as each was individually closed. Closing 2 of 5 queued
milestones and navigating away left the other 3 unmarked, so they reappeared on the next visit —
matching the "mostly the same medals" wording in the original report.

Fix: ProfilePage.jsx now batch-marks the entire newly-crossed set at queue time via
markMilestonesShown(startYear, ids) (single read + single write), not on dismissal.
Known tradeoff: milestones are marked seen the moment they are queued, so closing the tab
mid-queue means the remaining ones are never shown. Accepted deliberately.
